name: Cold bounded prior-study history, failure recovery and retained draft
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/resource_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 25 ACCEPTED SCOPES | accepted-scopes
keys: Space Down Space p
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | cold-scope-draft
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 HISTORICAL USAGE | cold-history-picker
require-live-snap: 25 resource-prior | loaded-history
keys: Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 Prior study: resource-prior | selected-prior
expect: 6/6 completed
ask: Does cold history load directly from the scope draft, without a Campaign visit, automatic selection, additional jobs or model requests?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: history-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: history-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: history-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: history-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: history-40x12
expect: Esc back
keys: PgDn
require-live-snap: 10 Partial history | partial-history-40x12
keys: PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn
live-snap: history-limits
ask: Can the operator read the partial-history limits and selected evidence, retaining selection and controls at all six sizes?
resize: 120x36
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/resource_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART break-history
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 History unavailable | failed-history
expect: resource-prior
ask: Does a history read failure keep the selected prior study and offer refresh without discarding the draft or changing spending?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/resource_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restore-history
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 Partial history | refreshed-history
expect: resource-prior
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | history-cancelled
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 HISTORICAL USAGE | reopened-history
keys: Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Usage evidence changed | chosen-history
expect: study resource-prior
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/resource_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART selected
ask: Does explicit selection retain the two-boundary draft and accounting, require separate plan approval and leave new discovery unstarted?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | no-color-restarted
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 25 ACCEPTED SCOPES | no-color-scopes
keys: Space Down Space p
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | no-color-draft
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 HISTORICAL USAGE | no-color-picker
require-live-snap: 25 resource-prior | no-color-loaded-history
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/resource_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
